# Slash-command autocomplete descriptions for built-in Pi commands, bundled
# extensions, and bundled skills/prompt templates.

jouzu-cli-session-slash-settings = Open settings menu
jouzu-cli-session-slash-model = Select model (opens selector UI)
jouzu-cli-session-slash-tree = Navigate session tree (switch branches)
jouzu-cli-session-slash-thinking = Set thinking level
jouzu-cli-session-slash-export = Export session (HTML default, or specify path: .html/.jsonl)
jouzu-cli-session-slash-import = Import and resume a session from a JSONL file
jouzu-cli-session-slash-share = Share session via a Radius artifact or a GitHub gist
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bug = Draft a bug report for Jouzu
jouzu-cli-session-slash-copy = Copy last agent message to clipboard
jouzu-cli-session-slash-name = Set session display name
jouzu-cli-session-slash-session = Show session info and stats
jouzu-cli-session-slash-changelog = Show changelog entries
jouzu-cli-session-slash-hotkeys = Show all keyboard shortcuts
jouzu-cli-session-slash-fork = Create a new fork from a previous user message
jouzu-cli-session-slash-clone = Duplicate the current session at the current position
jouzu-cli-session-slash-trust = Save project trust decision for future sessions
jouzu-cli-session-slash-login = Configure provider authentication
jouzu-cli-session-slash-logout = Remove provider authentication
jouzu-cli-session-slash-new = Start a new session
jouzu-cli-session-slash-compact = Manually compact the session context
jouzu-cli-session-slash-resume = Resume a different session
jouzu-cli-session-slash-reload = Reload keybindings, extensions, skills, prompts, themes, and context files
jouzu-cli-session-slash-quit = Quit Jouzu
jouzu-cli-session-slash-catalogs = Open Jouzu catalog settings
jouzu-cli-session-slash-about = Show Jouzu runtime and installed builds
jouzu-cli-session-slash-fast = Show Fast mode; on/off changes it for this session
jouzu-cli-session-slash-scrollback = Export the active transcript to the terminal scrollback
jouzu-cli-session-slash-flow = Show held, withheld, and waiting flow-control work, and repair a hold
jouzu-cli-session-slash-mcp = Manage MCP servers: sign in, reconnect, enable or disable, and change exposure
jouzu-cli-session-slash-llama = Manage llama.cpp router models
jouzu-cli-session-slash-tasks = Manage tasks — view, create, clear completed. '/tasks auto' enters auto-advance mode.
jouzu-cli-session-slash-goal = Set one objective and work toward it; a lightweight multiloop run
jouzu-cli-session-slash-multiloop = Start, resume, or manage autonomous iteration loops
jouzu-cli-session-slash-schedulePrompt = Manage scheduled prompts interactively
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bg = Background shell task dashboard and controls.
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bgList = Show tracked background tasks
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bgNext = Move the next bash command to a background task
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bgClear = Remove finished background tasks
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bgRun = Spawn a background shell task: /bg:run <command>
jouzu-cli-session-slash-bgStop = Terminate a running background task: /bg:stop <id>
jouzu-cli-session-slash-piVcc = Compact conversation with pi-vcc structured summary
jouzu-cli-session-slash-piVccRecall = Recall earlier parts of this session. Plain keywords work best; add scope:all to reach edited or retried turns.
jouzu-cli-session-slash-codePreviewHealth = Show code preview renderer health and settings
jouzu-cli-session-slash-codePreviewSettings = Configure code preview settings
jouzu-cli-session-slash-jouzuReview = Review the current change for correctness, regressions, data safety, tests, and documentation parity
jouzu-cli-session-slash-skillJouzuReference = Look up Jouzu settings, language, models/catalogs, profiles, session and trace locations, controls, and troubleshooting
jouzu-cli-session-slash-skillJouzuClearWriting = Draft, revise, or audit durable user-facing technical artifacts without changing facts
jouzu-cli-session-slash-skillJouzuAntiSlop = Remove filler, marketing language, and unsupported emphasis from existing prose without losing facts
jouzu-cli-session-slash-skillJouzuDelegation = Write and review subagent assignments, steering messages, and resume handoffs
jouzu-cli-session-slash-skillJouzuSourceCheck = Research and fact-check claims or sources through primary evidence, counterevidence, and confidence
jouzu-cli-session-slash-skillMultiloop = Run and manage autonomous work — quick goals through /goal and measured loops through /multiloop
